.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-gitea-git-blob 1  "geectl-gitea-git-blob 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-gitea\-git\-blob \- Show one git blob by its SHA: the decoded content of a file at a blob SHA. The text IS the content (as UTF\-8, invalid sequences replaced); the JSON payload carries the exact bytes base64\-encoded
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl gitea git\-blob\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIOWNER\fR> <\fIREPO\fR> <\fISHA\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show one git blob by its SHA: the decoded content of a file at a blob SHA. The text IS the content (as UTF\-8, invalid sequences replaced); the JSON payload carries the exact bytes base64\-encoded
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIOWNER\fR>
The repository owner
.TP
<\fIREPO\fR>
The repository name
.TP
<\fISHA\fR>
The blob SHA
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
